release-please-go

This is a partial port to Go of Release Please
(https://github.com/googleapis/release-please), Copyright Google LLC,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

The code was rewritten from scratch in Go rather than translated line by
line. Release-PR naming, labels, changelog layout, default changelog sections,
versioning rules and the x-release-please-version annotations follow the
behaviour of the original project.
